            "created_at": "2025-07-23T06:37:16.937117+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 5 is where things get interesting with this build. We pick up [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) to pair with [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505). Juno is the only hero in stadium who is able to repeatedly apply the healing reduction debuff from [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) to enemies with her primary fire with this combo. If you're picking up [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4), [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) is a must pick. \n\nFocus on just shooting the enemy tank and constantly applying the healing reduction debuff. As torpedoes also apply this debuff, try to hit as many enemies as possible to maximize the power of [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505)!\n\nIf you don't have enough cash, feel free to sell [Vantage Shot](item_6d7a0598-07cf-45ea-bbf5-c7e7b975e07a).",
